* Fileset member: a Natural program's DEFINE DATA VIEW over CUSTOMER-FILE.
* The view is the *program's* projection of the DDM — a subset of fields,
* with the occurrence counts the program is willing to handle.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 CUSTOMER-VIEW VIEW OF CUSTOMER-FILE
  2 CUSTOMER-NUMBER
  2 CUSTOMER-NAME
  2 CUSTOMER-STATUS
  2 BALANCE
  2 CURRENCY
  2 PHONE-NUMBER (1:5)
  2 CONTACT (1:3)
    3 CONTACT-TYPE
    3 CONTACT-VALUE
1 #SEARCH-KEY (A10)
1 #FOUND (L)
END-DEFINE
*
READ CUSTOMER-VIEW BY CUSTOMER-NUMBER STARTING FROM #SEARCH-KEY
  MOVE TRUE TO #FOUND
  DISPLAY CUSTOMER-NUMBER CUSTOMER-NAME BALANCE CURRENCY
END-READ
*
END
